{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a wild horse in the wild west! That's it . . . that's the game!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROAM is an  silly sandbox game where you play as a wild horse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u272e \u272e \u272e <strong>GAME FEATURES\u00a0</strong>\u272e \u272e \u272e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your horse and herd!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 The detailed horse editor allows you to create fun, unique horses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Choose their ages, genders, names, and appearances and build the horse family of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/extras/edit.gif?t=1733159498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your herd by rescuing captured horses and by breeding your horses!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Breed your horses to create unique foals and watch them grow up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Rescue other horses in the world and free them from the townsfolk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/extras/breed.gif?t=1733159498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take care of your horse and your herd!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 The horses have hunger and energy needs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Find your herd a safe oasis where they (and you) can relax and eat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/extras/interactions.gif?t=1733159498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as any of your horses using the horse-switch feature!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/extras/switch.gif?t=1733159498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cause havoc in the local towns - but try to avoid being captured!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 You can attack the local townsfolk if you feel like causing some chaos!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Try to avoid being captured! If you are, you will need to escape - and the townsfolk won't make it easy for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/extras/escape.gif?t=1733159498\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208940?t=1733159498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1733159498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/67d8db008429a975d697bf0d12d0da69b59aecf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733159498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208940/67d8db008429a975d697bf0d12d0da69b59aecf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733159498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a wild horse in the wild west! That's it . . . that's the game!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROAM is an  silly sandbox game where you play as a wild horse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u272e \u272e \u272e <strong>GAME FEATURES\u00a0</strong>\u272e \u272e \u272e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your horse and herd!</strong> </p><p